Package: rwsapi
Type: Package
Title: What the Package Does (Title Case)
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Willem Stolte, Tom Van Engeland
Maintainer: Willem Stolte <email@somewhere.net>
Description: The rwsapi package presents a number of functions for accessing water quality data from Rijkswaterstaat (NL).
  The core functions are rws_metadata() and rws_observations(), that respectively download the data catalog and actual
  observational data, based on queries in json notation. The provided data are collected over the past decades within the
  national monitoring programme for surface waters (fresh and saline) in the Netherlands (a.k.a. the DONAR / WADAR data).
